<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>10 / 待深化研究</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方向 6（系统侧）：纠错回溯与来源链</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#98A2B3' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>待研究</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={170} viewBox='0 0 1140 170'><rect x='0' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#0E2340' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='95.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>题目与参考解析版本</text><line x1='197' y1='84' x2='223' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M223 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='237' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='332.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>批改版本</text><line x1='434' y1='84' x2='460' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M460 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='474' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='569.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>步骤证据</text><line x1='671' y1='84' x2='697' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M697 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='711' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='806.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>掌握记录 / 报告</text><line x1='908' y1='84' x2='934' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M934 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='948' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1043.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>推荐与训练计划</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>修改后流程</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>先算影响范围并标记待复核 → 生成候选重算结果 → 保留原作答与旧报告 → 确认新版本时记录差异 → 必要时撤销已失效证据。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>不可删除项</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>已执行的训练与已发生的教师行动是历史事实，不能因推荐依据失效而被删除。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>变式处理</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>原题变式不是依赖旧题才成立的全部副本：变式进入风险复核，不无条件宣判全部无效。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>参考模型</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>借鉴 W3C PROV（实体、处理活动、参与者、来源关系）；初期用普通数据库关联即可，需要的是可查询的来源、版本与派生关系。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：待深化功能研究.md §3.3–§3.4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 100 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>